  "note": "Total Assets = Total Liabilities + Equity reconciles exactly. Discrete-quarter income figures cross-validated by subtraction from cumulative columns (e.g. total operating income row printed as '2,662,726,5240' due to a column-smearing artifact in the PDF's text layer; corrected to 2,662,726,524 using net interest income + non-interest income subtotal). This correction, and every other discrete-Q2-2020 income-statement figure in this file, is independently confirmed byte-for-byte against the Apr'20-Jun'20 comparative column printed in the bank's own 2021 H1 report (source: BRPD-14-June-2021-for-ABBL-Web.pdf) — except EPS: that report restates Apr'20-Jun'20 EPS to 0.07 (vs 0.08 reported contemporaneously here), consistent with a bonus-share issuance between the two periods (paid-up capital rose from 7,581,303,150 at this date to 8,358,386,710 by 30-Jun-2021) requiring restated weighted-average-share EPS in later comparatives. Per project convention, the contemporaneous value (0.08) is kept; the restatement is recorded here and in sources.json rather than silently reconciled."
